        "summary": "Opponent attacked with Zuko Exiled Prince (4/3), Aang Swift Savior (2/3 flying), and South Pole Voyager (2/2) — 8 total. Aang has flying so my only legal blocks are on the ground creatures. I'm blocking South Pole Voyager with Fire Lord Zuko: 2 damage kills the 2/2, my Zuko survives the 2 damage (4 toughness), and I kill an Ally to cut off their future Ally card-draw synergy. I take 6 (4 from Zuko + 2 from Aang) instead of 8, keeping my engine/blocker alive. Trading Zuko away to block the 4/3 would be a bad trade since 2 power doesn't kill its 3 toughness.",
